{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1004_p", "source_sha256": "84c775a007132af811309424f0cb9f03978b31130f6f242583c364c1cb13ae0f", "ja": "ちょうど前の仕事がこの近くだったので。\n……ところで、音無さん珍しいですね。", "zh": "正好之前的工作就在这附近。……对了，音无小姐，真少见啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9753f662247afe5b2cb5e08a57a710909c489f99ada39023b87e4abb19c8f012", "ja": "その制服、劇場ができる前に使っていた\n765プロの制服の、色違いのやつですよね？", "zh": "那套制服，是剧场成立前使用的765制作人的制服的不同配色，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "c3717c020cb8516913ed6e6deaf0b9363bd55dce2f2ce6c39131c2d271922d22", "ja": "ああっ！？　そういえば……！\n{$P$}さん、違うんですっ！", "zh": "啊！？这么说来……！\n{$P$}先生，不是这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5b057c3eca37459e6d37c5ed60bad47e82524db7e774ca4f0a2d971de1af0508", "ja": "えっと……何が違うんですか？", "zh": "呃……哪里不一样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "559da833c0c1e397c15b39b18db515d55321d70c327084ea8534af97e8476258", "ja": "この制服を着ているのには、\n海よりも深～いわけがありまして！", "zh": "我穿着这身制服，可是有着比大海还要深～的理由！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "09d4478f441801a4fb5b9170ac6c71a2ee7832de1c0efa8fccf4f8fe9e978a97", "ja": "決して、間違えて着てきてしまったとか、「今日は社長\nしかいないからいっか」と油断していたとかではなく！", "zh": "绝对不是不小心穿着这身制服就来了，也不是因为想着“今天只有社长在，穿一下也没关系吧”就放松了警惕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "5d15e64a4f380caf521e1763a48ae5b4776125f9d7c65e8f39b54564c6956fbc", "ja": "ましてや、ゲームに夢中で洗濯を忘れて、他に\n着るものが無くなってしまった、なんてことは……！", "zh": "更不是因为沉迷游戏忘了洗衣服，结果连其他能穿的衣服都没了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2d4d327365d7a4499945ad0d45d66699033d0b50d651dd4a09d2b67aeb7d3122", "ja": "あっ、なるほど。でも、気にしなくていいと\n思いますよ。趣味の時間も大切ですし。", "zh": "啊，原来如此。不过，我觉得不用在意。享受兴趣爱好的时间也很重要嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0e8b0eb105959adc7723d333991aecab72bbed5075cf1471c49b4f9cd81e1a44", "ja": "ゲームって、ついつい時間を忘れてしまいますよね！", "zh": "玩游戏总是不知不觉就忘了时间呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "572cbe20b8f28f62ad122942194fd5872f931c5c7d48491201e2e3a91f1803f0", "ja": "そうなんですよ！　仲間との冒険が楽しくて……。\nって、だから違うんですって！", "zh": "就是啊！和伙伴们一起冒险特别开心……  \n不对，都说了不是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9e5fddea897d010e347dbf282a68a58a26734485a8ece9a91771aac4274b327a", "ja": "はははっ。すみません、つい。それにその制服、\n音無さんにすごく似合ってると思いますよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈。不好意思，一不小心就……而且，我觉得这身制服非常适合音无小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "1461beaf0020b8a47e90af40fc581ab7f3d88929337c936a5dcfcbaf65eca9e4", "ja": "ピヨッ！？　こ、こほん。\nもう……からかわないでください。でも……。", "zh": "啾！？咳、咳。真是的……别取笑我。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "1c05da8aadb9f139c8b0228a78f42c974f3a2a316501fec31c53feac32593c8f", "ja": "私もこの制服、気に入ってるんです。みんなで\n頑張ってきた思い出が、たくさん詰まっていますから。", "zh": "我也很喜欢这套制服。因为其中承载着我们大家一起努力至今的许多回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "bcee493d12f62ed49fead1619c5b4c5dec7e447449d26798299e22ac6f738e93", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも\n見られちゃいましたし……またたまに着てみようかな？", "zh": "都被{$P$}先生看见了……之后偶尔再穿穿看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0023_1018_p", "source_sha256": "76490af6162c6dd8a5601012ef57fe71da360e479c12d8841c7d8b8a0987bf9f", "ja": "はい。みんなも見たいと思いますし、ぜひまた！\n……それじゃそろそろ、劇場に戻りますね。", "zh": "好的。大家应该也都想看，之后一定要再穿哦！\n……那么差不多该回剧场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
